      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "int f(int A[], int n, int x)\n{\n    if(n == 0) return -1;    \n\n    if(A[n - 1] == x) return n - 1;\n     \n    return f(A, n - 1, x);   \n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int f(int A[], int n, int x)\n{\n    if(n == 0) return -1;    \n\n    if(A[n - 1] == x) return n - 1;\n     \n    return f(A, n - 1, x);   \n}",
